  "slug": "lost-and-found-inventory-log-form",
  "title": "Lost and Found Inventory Log Form",
  "subtitle": "Hold the storage position: tagged items with holding periods, items reaching disposition, the cash ledger, and the count that proves it.",
  "description": "An original storage inventory and disposition log. It records the log period and count basis, the tagged item register with holding-period status, items reaching their disposition date with the decision and authorizer, a separately reconciled cash and high-value ledger, count variances, and an accountable period closeout.",
  "use_case": "Use for a defined period when storage must prove what it holds, what has passed its holding period, and what was released, returned, donated, or disposed of. The log closes when the physical count reconciles and every expired item has a recorded disposition.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
  "sections": [
    {
