            "Contact attempts to a known owner recorded before disposition",
            "Identification documents routed for secure destruction or return, never donated",
            "Payment cards routed for secure destruction and the issuer not contacted",
            "Medication disposed of through the route applicable policy requires",
            "High-value items reviewed by the responsible manager before disposition",
            "Donation recipient and date recorded where an item was donated",
            "Disposal method recorded so it can be evidenced later"
          ]
        }
